s the Water Bird petroglyph site; preserve entry is free.","source_url":"https://www.flagstaff.az.gov/2881/Picture-Canyon","source_title":"Picture Canyon Natural & Cultural Preserve","source_kind":"government","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Free and open to the public year-round. Respect cultural-resource rules and do not climb on or mark petroglyphs.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"nau-flagstaff-petroglyph-overlook","subject_type":"place","entity_name":"Petroglyph Overlook","title":"Pause at Petroglyph Overlook","subtitle":"Don Weaver Trail · Picture Canyon Natural & Cultural Preserve","notes":"Use the overlook to observe from a respectful distance, keep to the trail, and avoid touching, climbing on, or photographing artifacts up close.","short_summary":"A designated viewing point reached on Don Weaver Trail.","evidence_claim":"The City identifies Petroglyph Overlook as part of Don Weaver Trail and instructs visitors not to deface or remove cultural resources; the preserve is free.","source_url":"https://www.flagstaff.az.gov/2881/Picture-Canyon","source_title":"Picture Canyon Natural & Cultural Preserve","source_kind":"government","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Free and open to the public year-round; cultural-resource etiquette and laws apply.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"nau-flagstaff-water-bird-petroglyph","subject_type":"place","entity_name":"Water Bird Petroglyph Site","title":"See the Water Bird Petroglyph Site","subtitle":"Tom Moody Loop · Picture Canyon Natural & Cultural Preserve","notes":"Follow Tom Moody Loop to the named site, look without handling the rock art, and let the visit be a low-impact shared history stop.","short_summary":"A named petroglyph viewing stop on the preserve loop.","evidence_claim":"The City s