 the Arizona Trail.","evidence_claim":"The City lists a 1.5-mile Arizona Trail segment within Picture Canyon, says it has little elevation change, and states the preserve is free to the public.","source_url":"https://www.flagstaff.az.gov/2881/Picture-Canyon","source_title":"Picture Canyon Natural & Cultural Preserve","source_kind":"government","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Free and open to the public year-round; motorized vehicles are not allowed in the preserve.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"nau-flagstaff-beasley-gallery","subject_type":"place","entity_name":"Beasley Gallery","title":"Browse Beasley Gallery","subtitle":"Performing and Fine Arts, Building 37, Room 216 · NAU","notes":"Drop in during Wednesday or Thursday public hours to view the rotating exhibitions, then check the gallery’s official channel for updates.","short_summary":"NAU’s public gallery for rotating and student exhibitions.","evidence_claim":"NAU states that Beasley Gallery is free and open to the public and gives current Wednesday–Thursday hours of 10 a.m.–4 p.m.","source_url":"https://in.nau.edu/school-art-design/galleries/beasley-gallery/","source_title":"Beasley Gallery","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Free and open to the public; listed current hours are Wednesday and Thursday, 10 a.m.–4 p.m., or by appointment.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"nau-flagstaff-lowell-culture-pass","subject_type":"place","entity_name":"Lowell Observatory","title":"Check Out a Lowell Culture Pass","subtitle":"Lowell Observatory · Flagstaff","notes":"Eligible NAU students can ask at Cline Library’s Ask Us! desk, confirm availability, and use the pass within its seven-day checkout window.","short_summary":"A free-admission option for two through Cline Library.","evidence_claim":"Cline Library lists Lowell Observatory among available Culture Pass venues; each pass provides one-time free general admission for two people.","source_url":"https://nau.edu/library/culture-pass/","source_title":"Culture Pass | Cline Library","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Culture Pass checkouts are restricted to NAU/CCC students, faculty, and staff; availability is first-come, first-served and special events are excluded.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"nau-flagstaff-museum-northern-arizona-culture-pass","subject_type":"place","entity_name":"Museum of Northern Arizona","title":"Use a Culture Pass at MNA","subtitle":"Museum of Northern Arizona · Flagstaff","notes":"Check the pass inventory at Cline Library before making plans, then use the one-time general-admission benefit for a two-person museum outing.","short_summary":"Museum entry covered for two by an eligible Culture Pass.","evidence_claim":"Cline Library lists the Museum of Northern Arizona as an available Culture Pass venue and says each pass gives free general admission for two people.","source_url":"https://nau.edu/library/culture-pass/","source_title":"Culture Pass | Cline Library","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"For NAU/CCC students, faculty, and staff; passes are first-come, first-served and do not cover special events or separately ticketed activities.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"nau-flagstaff-arb-culture-pass","subject_type":"place","entity_name":"The Arb at Flagstaff","title":"Reserve a Culture Pass for The Arb","subtitle":"The Arb at Flagstaff · Flagstaff","notes":"Start at Cline Library’s Ask Us! desk, verify a pass is available, and plan a two-person general-admission visit within seven days.","short_summary":"A Flagstaff garden visit covered by a library pass.","evidence_claim":"Cline Library lists The Arb at Flagstaff among available Culture Pass destinations and states that each pass is valid for free admission for two people.","source_url":"https://nau.edu/library/culture-pass/","source_title":"Culture Pass | Cline Library","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Culture Pass access is for NAU/CCC students, faculty, and staff; passes are first-come, first-served and exclude special events.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true}],"warnings":[]}],"warnings":[]}
